# Push updates to GitHub

After you change this project's code, commit that update and push it to GitHub.

- Remote: `origin`
- URL: `https://github.com/NeverSMILE0825/GMGN-Label-Extension.git`
- Push the current branch. Do not force-push.

Do this when a code change in this repo is finished. Skip the push when the tree has no new changes, and do not commit secrets.
